# 115. DEFINITION OF DONE V2

Moon Server V2 consolidation is DONE only when this statement is accurate:

> MoonWitness is an application composed on top of a reusable Moon Server runtime. Moon Server owns transport, authentication, generic REST, explicit RPC, realtime transport, addon lifecycle, request context, infrastructure facades, health and observability. Moon ORM owns relational persistence through PostgreSQL. Valkey provides explicitly defined ephemeral/shared runtime capabilities rather than becoming a second database. MinIO provides object storage behind a Moon storage abstraction with PostgreSQL metadata and Moon authorization. Moon Server exports meaningful metrics that actually reach VictoriaMetrics, and structured redacted logs have a real delivery path into Loki. Domain addons remain independent of Fastify and infrastructure SDKs. Ordinary HTTP requests never execute implicitly as superuser. Backend and infrastructure behavior are protected by automated tests and CI.

Anything less means the migration is still in progress.

---

# 116. FINAL INFRASTRUCTURE NORTH STAR

Keep this model throughout implementation:

```text
                           Moon Server
                               │
            ┌──────────────────┼───────────────────┐
            │                  │                   │
            ▼                  ▼                   ▼
         Moon ORM         Moon Cache         Moon Storage
            │                  │                   │
            ▼                  ▼                   ▼
        PostgreSQL           Valkey              MinIO


                           Moon Server
                               │
                    ┌──────────┴──────────┐
                    │                     │
                    ▼                     ▼
                 Metrics              Structured Logs
                    │                     │
                    ▼                     ▼
            VictoriaMetrics             Loki

```

And:

```text
PostgreSQL
= durable relational source of truth

Valkey
= ephemeral/shared runtime acceleration and coordination

MinIO
= durable binary/object storage

VictoriaMetrics
= operational metrics backend

Loki
= centralized structured log backend

```

Never blur these responsibilities without a strong architectural reason.

